    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρασκευ-αστέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be prepared</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicostr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.23.62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τέον</span>, <i>one must prepare</i> or
				<i>provide</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μὴ κινδυνεῦσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					467b
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως μὴ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				480e
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως εὐπειθεῖς οἱ ἄνδρες ὦσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτῳ πολλοὺς ἐπαινέτας
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.7.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (from 
				Pass.
			) <i>one must prepare oneself, be ready</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲν δεῖσθαί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					507d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
